  "band_coverage": {
    "method": "h1-h4; per origin 1000 reduced-form posterior draws of the no-dummy BVAR(4) refit through the origin, one stochastic GDP path each (raw, not recalibrated); gdp_only maps the GDP quantile paths through the fitted equation (the bands published before); gdp_residual adds a N(0, sigma) residual per step; joint also draws the coefficients from N(coef, sigma^2 (X'X)^-1). Residual and coefficient draws are independent of the GDP shock path. Seed 20261116 + origin index.",
    "caveat": "73 overlapping origins: binomial s.e. about 0.035 at 90% and 0.055 at 68% before serial correlation, so the true uncertainty is larger. The GDP paths come from a no-dummy BVAR refit per origin, not the production specification, and raw SVAR GDP bands themselves under-cover. Assumes a stable GDP-unemployment relation and a constant Gaussian residual variance (Covid quarters excluded from the fit). Latest-vintage data (pseudo-, not real-time).",
